{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "document-catalog-carry",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "承接",
    "lang": "zh-CN",
    "description": "一段 15 秒的短片：每个边界都有东西活过去，镜头由人操作。",
    "plugins": [
      "@lincyaw/addon-motion",
      "@lincyaw/addon-lecture"
    ],
    "renderers": {
      "web": {},
      "lecture": {}
    }
  },
  "sectionOrder": [
    "film"
  ],
  "sections": {
    "film": {
      "id": "film",
      "title": "一个点",
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        "film--notes",
        "film--shot"
      ],
      "stepOrder": [
        "film--step-0",
        "film--step-1",
        "film--step-2",
        "film--step-3",
        "film--step-4",
        "film--step-5"
      ],
      "layout": {
        "type": "stack",
        "renderers": {
          "slides": {
            "layout": "full"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "blocks": {
    "film--notes": {
      "id": "film--notes",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "film--notes--n0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一个点依次变成 Presmium 做出的每一样东西：文稿、步骤、幻灯片、视频的一帧，最后是片名。整片是一个 defineScene 场景，每拍一个状态；每个边界都用一种不同的承接动作（morphRect、ribbon、iris、镜头拉远加 hop、seal），镜头有跟随、甩、静止时零漂移、落地震动，背后是一层远处的点阵。动作来自 gallery/lengths/scenes/kit/fx/moves.ts 与 camera.ts。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "film--notes--n1",
          "type": "table",
          "headerRows": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "film--notes--n1--r0",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r0c0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "时间"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r0c1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "画面"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r0c2",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "带入下一拍"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "film--notes--n1--r1",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r1c0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "0–1.2 s"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r1c1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "强调色的点从上方落到正中，落地压扁、回弹，镜头随之一震；0.85 s 起静止"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r1c2",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点本身：morphRect 把这个圆角矩形展开成文稿页"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "film--notes--n1--r2",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r2c0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "1.2–3.4 s"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r2c1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "点展开成 lecture.json 的一页，镜头跟着从 2.4 倍拉到 1 倍；三个块的线条依次从块后升起；2.5 s 起静止"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r2c2",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "这一页：它成为弹性轨道的第一格"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "film--notes--n1--r3",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r3c0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "3.4–4.9 s"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r3c1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "连击三下（3.55、3.95、4.35 s）：先点亮步骤 1，再两次把轨道换到步骤 2、3，页面回弹、文字滞后；每一下镜头同向推近一级（1 → 1.42 倍）并轻震"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r3c2",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "步骤 3 的圆点：光圈从它打开"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "film--notes--n1--r4",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r4c0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "4.9–7.1 s"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r4c1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "光圈从圆点打开到盖满画面，露出幻灯片“注意力”，内容弹入；6.1 s 起静止"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r4c2",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "整个画面：镜头拉远，幻灯片成了播放器里的一帧"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "film--notes--n1--r5",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r5c0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "7.1–9.6 s"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r5c1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "镜头拉远到播放器（log 空间变焦），关键节点沿弧线跳到时间轴上成为播放头，落地压扁、轨道震动，进度条随后填上；8.9 s 起静止"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r5c2",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "播放键：它长成转动的封印"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "film--notes--n1--r6",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r6c0",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "9.6–15 s"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r6c1",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "镜头甩到播放键，播放键长成一面转半圈的强调色圆盘铺满画面；标志弹入，Presmium 逐字落下压扁，口号升起；11.7 s 起静止 3.3 s"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "film--notes--n1--r6c2",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "片尾（裸切也可以，这里用封印承接）"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "film--shot": {
      "id": "film--shot",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "film--shot--definition",
      "parameters": {
        "scene": "one-dot",
        "alt": "一个强调色的点落下，展开成文稿的一页；三下连击依次点亮三个步骤；光圈从步骤 3 的圆点打开出幻灯片；镜头拉远，幻灯片是视频的一帧，节点跳上时间轴成为播放头；播放键长成转动的圆盘，片名 Presmium 落下。"
      }
    }
  },
